ISSUE DESCRIPTION:
Found while seeding the language packs (#444). Same shape as #445: `lang_Addexpensing` does two unrelated jobs.

[frontend/modals/customer.html:765](https://github.com/Posnic/POS/blob/develop/frontend/modals/customer.html#L765)
